# What in this repository was written by somebody else, and why it is here.
#
# RENDERING.md R3: where the source ships a working interface, the port ships that
# interface rather than one of its own. teable's is a Next.js application over a
# workspace of shared packages, so reusing it means having the workspace too --
# every path below is teable's own source, built here, with four files changed
# (next.config.js, src/backend/api/rest/axios.ts, packages/sdk useInstances.ts and
# useConnection.tsx) so the data comes from this port and arrives on a stream.
#
# toolkit/source_hygiene.py and toolkit/copied_strings.py read this file and say
# what they skipped, rather than reporting a hundred thousand lines nobody wrote.

webapp/apps/    # teable's Next.js application, vendored to satisfy R3
webapp/packages/  # the workspace packages that application builds against
webapp/plugins/   # a workspace sibling the build resolves by name
webapp/node_modules/  # installed dependencies of the above
webapp  # the pnpm workspace files at the root of the reused front end
